{
  "version": "0.1.4-beta.1",
  "notes": "  新增\r\n\r\n  - 服务器监控 — 终端标签页内显示 CPU（含每核心）、磁盘用量、主 IP 地址，支持配置刷新间隔，支持持久显示\r\n  - 连接配置分组 — SSH 连接配置支持分组管理，可折叠/展开，支持分组内直接连接和编辑\r\n  - SSH 配置导入 — 支持从 ~/.ssh/config 文件批量导入连接配置\r\n  - 密钥库自动解锁 — 新增混合密钥存储模式，支持启动时自动解锁密钥库\r\n  - SSH 主机密钥验证 — 支持多种主机密钥验证模式，提升连接安全性\r\n  - SFTP 粘贴上传 — 支持通过剪贴板粘贴文件到远程目录\r\n  - SFTP 全选快捷键 — 支持键盘快捷键全选 SFTP 文件列表\r\n  - 关闭左侧标签页 — 标签页右键菜单新增\"关闭左侧标签页\"选项\r\n  - 开发者工具开关 — 设置中新增开发者工具切换，便于调试\r\n  - 标签栏连接元数据 — 标签栏显示连接状态等额外信息\r\n  - 终端自定义滚动条 — xterm.js 终端自动隐藏式细滚动条\r\n\r\n  优化\r\n\r\n  - 主题预设增加色调标签，预览色板翻译更完善\r\n  - SFTP 目录导航逻辑重构，交互更流畅\r\n  - 标签页悬停效果和层级管理优化\r\n  - 全局 focus-visible 焦点轮廓，提升键盘可访问性\r\n  - 设置页面布局重构，新增连接设置独立标签页\r\n  - PTY 会话管理增加 nonce 机制，状态同步更可靠\r\n  - 更新下载逻辑优化，自动清理过期文件\r\n\r\n  修复\r\n\r\n  - 修复 URI 路径解码引用错误\r\n  - 修复 scrollback 行数归一化问题\r\n\r\n  ---\r\n\r\n  Added\r\n\r\n  - Server Monitoring — CPU (per-core), disk usage, primary IP displayed in terminal tabs, with configurable refresh interval and persistent visibility\r\n  - Connection Profile Groups — Group SSH profiles with collapsible sections, direct connect and edit actions per group\r\n  - SSH Config Import — Bulk import connections from ~/.ssh/config\r\n  - Vault Auto-Unlock — Hybrid secret storage mode with automatic vault unlock on startup\r\n  - SSH Host Key Verification — Multiple host key verification modes for enhanced connection security\r\n  - SFTP Paste Upload — Upload files to remote directories via clipboard paste\r\n  - SFTP Select All — Keyboard shortcut to select all items in the SFTP file list\r\n  - Close Tabs to Left — New context menu option to close all tabs to the left\r\n  - Developer Tools Toggle — Toggle developer tools from settings for debugging\r\n  - Tab Bar Metadata — Connection metadata shown in tab bar with improved overflow styling\r\n  - Custom Terminal Scrollbar — Auto-thin scrollbar for xterm.js with visibility enforcement\r\n\r\n  Improved\r\n\r\n  - Theme preset tone labels and preview swatch translations\r\n  - Refactored SFTP directory navigation for smoother interaction\r\n  - Tab item hover effects and z-index management\r\n  - Global focus-visible outlines for better keyboard accessibility\r\n  - Settings layout refactored with dedicated Connection settings tab\r\n  - PTY session management with nonce for reliable state synchronization\r\n  - Update download handling with stale file cleanup\r\n\r\n  Fixed\r\n\r\n  - Fixed reference error in URI path percent-decoding\r\n  - Fixed scrollback lines normalization\n",
